#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:5
#: 2a7ee8c0d76a4f69b2292c3b7827e0ef 3088b071285b492ca6e95edf825c9d40
#: 9b88f81e244b41db92876ad392c287ca b93ffa47971148d0af7939fb1d15207f
#: d2b8ef58a94c4901a77394cf7e86ca42 fca9bc6b0b114b74a643b1147cccfae6
msgid "i-BUS Telemetry"
msgstr "i-BUS 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:7
#: 1dafed6227c24ca2a2c2615abeef092e 379c3f41845348b3affe9ee1e3249b67
#: 5a9dd3c7df72441387339e088818f0ea 7ffc6c0b5ef04446aa462ff85d49e8ef
#: 8f63438bc5d746b69179c72ecd4a1935 973810843493416099f0a62c8ddd758c
msgid ""
"i-BUS telemetry allows you to display ArduPilot information such as flight "
"modes, battery level, and speed, as well as information from other supported"
" i-BUS telemetry values on `Flysky <https://www.flysky-cn.com/plane>`__ and "
"Turnigy transmitters (using stock, modified, or OpenTX firmware) when using "
"an i-BUS receiver with a SENS port (such as the `iA6B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ia6b-canshu>`__, `FTr8B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ftr8bspecifications>`__, etc)."
msgstr ""
"i-BUS 数传允许在使用带 SENS 端口的 i-BUS 接收机（如 `iA6B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ia6b-canshu>`__、`FTr8B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ftr8bspecifications>`__ 等）时，在 `Flysky <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/plane>`__ 和 Turnigy 遥控器（使用原厂、修改版或 OpenTX 固件）上显示 ArduPilot "
"信息，如飞行模式、电量和速度，以及其他支持的 i-BUS 数传值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:9
#: 0a5a5d8c6f2a482c8a10d42e54671d27 5b6109890c2747cfb303adf0af66c409
#: 648bbf12bb28462f85432f93c6f55614 8a5bcc3fabaf4c73af1cfb463c41ec52
#: e7a5fe314ad14d1793301b5d9b4f1757 fcfdb3e6d0c44715a8e0e1a9729deb66
msgid "It is particularly useful:"
msgstr "它特别适用于："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:11
#: 014df9474b464be3b7523154db6a3905 064bfe79e8d743d891f005982ebe95d0
#: 1ddbbef427bc43b0b9ecec4c26e4d26c 3ca5dbf8c4324f59bde4c9f29d17ce84
#: ce98509864e948b6ba312bed5940d512 de226f35fd0c4283849993dc2280dc17
msgid ""
"for flying without a ground control station (no need for MAVLink telemetry "
"radio),"
msgstr "无地面控制站飞行（无需 MAVLink 数传电台），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:12
#: 1a6c03abf0ce456587ef44b6733e6080 623329252d3340599279b395688e9370
#: 6dfb6d5a47eb42e3bfdc3b4960c204d4 952ffe9a903147f99506f0efcc649600
#: 9b5902c096784d2590946afe602e3c38 f11ef3ae721e4a8bac8d286f62e7cd8b
msgid ""
"as a backup in case the ground station fails (e.g., loss of MAVLink radio "
"link),"
msgstr "地面站故障时的备份（如 MAVLink 无线链路丢失），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:13
#: 3811ca7bf9dd462895de4937dcfc6274 7b4857a0ceda4651b2499312fb593f8b
#: a13d534c677d4e5cabf74eb1eba57d87 a14e081ca24d48209f379bc90d7cc119
#: fa063b889fba43819036ea59f7131563 fa98f0b63fbe4544a5fbcc90e78cbe46
msgid "when a separate person operates the ground control station,"
msgstr "由专门的人员操作地面控制站时，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:14
#: 1f076badff3649deb7ca113b33b30a05 8659d60cbda9446ba1c2fc831c1b8dbc
#: 87ae212025be45a2b7dc42242ff29ad8 b033b15cc38d4f4292af5769041249e0
#: b47331de2c4d4c6597f228358992f0d0 b846271cd5ab4f81becc2b38124323c5
msgid "for quick situational awareness by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手快速了解飞行状况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:16
#: 0b9fddcf1bcf437eb5d3c16c42af759d 422db037c17849289f5708c8a9c23b03
#: 47a4b78fd6f14eeeacab96f7ee795356 4f4ef9d6a3514885ba956a56eb48f378
#: cf1cb80bb1c04e6b923e19352b8c0f16 d2fd31d680e846139f783a095aece1fc
msgid ""
"Moreover, some RC transmitters such as the Flysky FS-i6X can be modified "
"with OpenTX firmware, enabling a lot more functionality based on incoming "
"telemetry than stock firmware allows."
msgstr "此外，部分 RC 遥控器（如 Flysky FS-i6X）可通过 OpenTX 固件进行改装，基于传入的数传数据实现比原厂固件更多的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:22
#: 220f46b7e5c04b77b6058b46943cf652 2310258e7a564888b35ccaa369ae2f66
#: 714b8f4721e149f7a3c7d4fbeb927c64 735ff286a6944d2faad158d446597fdd
#: a7d5187a3b714dcc92752d9382b4a7b4 f96bd24b744345bfb7989301c9614305
