msgstr ""
"Flysky FS-i6X（OpenTX）：进入机型配置的 *TELEMETRY* 部分，向下滚动选择 *Sensors* > *Discover "
"new*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:61
#: 09cc70a511194217a08c8c2c4d4d948d 3d9d1c2a0ee943e6b66aff08e1935416
#: 3f8df8568a8d46489be38f4132da5f02 3fe9a71df320407cb7fae6f4bf76dbf0
#: e845c35b1a3c4079bf58526a4d491405 eb30a4ebbf7d4e6f8fc173ea177cb385
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:63
#: 209eaaf5ff67466e8e07950efc3804d4 465e2361f60b43b9a6bcf951494b81df
#: 8fc7534180a34a728dd3ad5fe9eba712 9bbb514bd1a24de999c4d919c2f55198
#: bca398e41bb9447589996c7b2a192476 ce262016b2f2403c83894811e454a019
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports most standard i-BUS sensors for which it has a logical "
"equivalent data source. Most receivers, however, will only request the first"
" 15 available sensors and ignore the rest. Therefore the sensor types have "
"been sorted in order of subjective value for use on transmitters with small "
"screens such as entry-level Flysky transmitters."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持大多数标准 i-BUS 传感器（有对应逻辑数据源的）。但大多数接收机只请求前 15 "
"个可用传感器而忽略其余的。因此，传感器类型已按主观价值排序，以便在小屏幕遥控器（如入门级 Flysky 遥控器）上使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:65
#: 06b31695754d4859961ef49182383359 0761e4672f5b404b87b7e2136ed69231
#: 3d9c9061398c414bb46dfdd8d9fa8493 5206abffa4864b92965df5946d33abbe
#: 6fa2ac68d9f142fd8616a0d2ac25a782 ed492b75a2c4401cb2de41df9e9438db
msgid ""
"Some sensors provide multiple values while only using one slot. Some (such "
"as GPS location or XYZ data) are logical groups of information but require a"
" sensor slot for each data point."
msgstr "部分传感器提供多个值但只占用一个槽位。部分传感器（如 GPS 位置或 XYZ 数据）是信息的逻辑分组，但每个数据点都需要一个传感器槽位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:67
#: 32b4e4e1fe5441afa76c8b5c2e2b4bef 949a8acbfc834695b970ed63f6c4aeeb
#: 9a76db55c99641a3a9582b471ded9df3 bd91e0cc4f3745bb994505fe39c2512b
#: e62ebb6c8445429ca5347e670f27708a f063100634c74cee9911b46b427ec3f9
msgid ""
"If any sensors require features that have been excluded from your board's "
"build, those sensors will be excluded from the list allowing lower priority "
"sensors into the top 15 slots."
msgstr "如果某些传感器需要已从板卡固件中排除的功能，这些传感器将从列表中移除，允许优先级较低的传感器进入前 15 个槽位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:69
#: 2419acda408d45898a05efae7de1b42d 7389e7d5987445a09ec007afe799a883
#: a6f22c3d2a084b99a2a40d36deff5feb e0a9841dd95641cfb9a021bb9468b114
#: e70f9b55410c4205b05ec1e7d78c9e67 fb869f2960344b619ff17848e5598d13
msgid ""
"If you have a receiver that doesn't follow the standard limit and opts to "
"allow more sensors in exchange for a fractionally slower update frequency, "
"you will receive extra telemetry."
msgstr "如果您的接收机不遵守标准限制，以稍低的更新频率为代价允许更多传感器，您将获得额外的数传信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:71
#: 15dd1d71f31c44b89cf35bd0277d6d62 6685078827714b6092ccafcfdb42bc91
#: 6fdbc8d490a2405cb0f4de92c2d9cdc0 83181153d63b498bb90e9e9f3d8398a6
#: ac9cf3bf4a1c4b139e6eecd250cbbb4c ca9a3f014d714333ada0173d8084fd12
msgid "The sensor priority order is:"
msgstr "传感器优先级顺序为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:73
#: 328da7acb22b425e860d733aecf9bb59 3bf6171e157248e19e141d371be92cf5
#: 40e48f792fd24bcc9fce3e4d172c2254 8d0f5a0cacff4092bdf734bfda2a2d55
#: 9730c762ffc9415fa1cd39cc66d37c97 9e8d784d1d8544218cc96f56f2d6d3f0
msgid "Armed status (Armed/UnArmed on stock/modified firmware; 0/1 on OpenTX)"
msgstr "解锁状态（原厂/修改版固件显示 Armed/UnArmed；OpenTX 显示 0/1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:74
#: 30e98ebf87514a91b91906a3ff1f4f43 40541d9cfe2349deb95f444a5d48d856
#: 44f2eb4a14734e9ca20e7c8ace0aa698 7fa55d22ff894332b0fc2d36ef81fac7
