"Flight mode (where an equivalent i-BUS mode exists, otherwise blank; just a "
"number on OpenTX)"
msgstr "飞行模式（存在等效 i-BUS 模式时显示，否则为空；OpenTX 上仅显示数字）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:75
#: 497ad36b4db9413e8e2305a1bded184f 7bdc7157ae70405fa911eec6e56e9759
#: 7f3f3ab56e4c4c828a66feda09d2b50f 86339739484d40f6af04fe6f554be6b4
